34: 
35: **Purpose**: Project initialization and buildable skeleton
36: 
37: - [X] T001 Create Maven project at repository root (`pom.xml`) for Java 17 with Spring Boot
38:       3.x starters: web, security, thymeleaf, data-jpa, validation; plus H2 runtime
39:       dependency and spring-boot-starter-test + spring-security-test (test scope)
40: - [X] T002 [P] Create `src/main/resources/application.yml`: embedded H2 datasource,
