136: ## Phase 4: User Story 2 - Manage Roles and Edit Role Permissions (Priority: P2)
137: 
138: **Goal**: Admins create, rename, delete roles and edit role-permission sets in a single
139: screen, with lockout and concurrency protections.
140: 
141: **Independent Test**: Sign in as a user granted `role.*` (+ `permission.view`) — role CRUD
142: and the role-permission editor work; a user lacking `role.permissions.edit` gets 403 on the
143: editor; deleting/skipping the final protected role is refused with 409.
144: 
145: ### Tests for User Story 2 (write FIRST, ensure they FAIL before implementation)
146: 
147: - [X] T021 [P] [US2] Dual-sided authorization tests in
148:       `src/test/java/com/example/rbac/security/RoleAuthorizationTest.java` covering every
149:       GET/POST in `contracts/roles.md` (incl. `role.permissions.edit` and `role.delete`)
150: - [X] T022 [X] [US2] Guardrail + concurrency tests in
151:       `src/test/java/com/example/rbac/guardrails/RoleGuardrailTest.java`: G1 (delete last
152:       protected role → 409, no change), optimistic-lock conflict (second save → 409)
153:       (FR-010/FR-013)
154: - [X] T023 [P] [US2] Service tests in `src/test/java/com/example/rbac/service/RoleServiceTest.java`:
155:       role CRUD, permission-set replacement exactness, active-only grant enforcement, G1
156: 
157: ### Implementation for User Story 2
158: 
159: - [X] T024 [US2] Implement `RoleService` in
160:       `src/main/java/com/allensandiego/adm/service/RoleService.java` (CRUD, `savePermissionSet`
161:       full-replace semantics, G1 guardrail calling PermissionResolver, optimistic locking) —
162:       depends on T004–T010
163: - [X] T025 [P] [US2] Implement `RoleController` in
164:       `src/main/java/com/example/rbac/web/RoleController.java` including the role-permission
165:       editor (list w/ paging+search, new, detail, edit, permissions, delete) per
166:       `contracts/roles.md`
- [X] T026 [P] [US2] Create Role Thymeleaf templates (list, new, detail, edit,
      permissions-editor with live checkboxes, inactive permissions read-only) in
      `src/main/resources/templates/role/` — matched controller model attributes:
      roles (List<Role>), totalPages, currentPage, searchTerm, size (list.html); role (Role)
      (new/detail/edit/permissions.html); permissions (PageResult<Permission>) (permissions.html)
173:       RoleServiceTest green; manual pass of Quickstart steps 2 and 5 (Super Admin refusal)
174: 
175: **Checkpoint**: Roles and role-permission editing functional; builds on US1.
