179: ## Phase 5: User Story 3 - Manage Users and Assign Roles (Priority: P3)
180: 
181: **Goal**: Admins create users, view/edit accounts, activate/deactivate, and assign roles,
182: with effective-permission visibility and final-admin guardrails.
183: 
184: **Independent Test**: Sign in as a user granted `user.*` (+ `role.view`,
185: `permission.view`) — user CRUD and role assignment work; detail shows the exact union of
186: active permissions; removing the final admin access is refused with 409; deactivated users
187: get 403 everywhere.
188: 
189: ### Tests for User Story 3 (write FIRST, ensure they FAIL before implementation)
190: 
191: - [X] T029 [P] [US3] Dual-sided authorization tests in
192:       `src/test/java/com/example/rbac/security/UserAuthorizationTest.java` covering every
193:       GET/POST in `contracts/users.md` (incl. `user.roles.assign`, `user.activate`)
194: - [X] T030 [P] [US3] Guardrail + effective-permission tests in
195:       `src/test/java/com/example/rbac/guardrails/UserGuardrailTest.java`: G2 (remove last
196:       protected-role assignment → 409), G3 (deactivate final admin → 409), deactivated user
197:       → empty permission set, effective set == exact union of active permissions of assigned
198:       roles (FR-010/FR-008/SC-005)
199: - [X] T031 [P] [US3] Service tests in `src/test/java/com/example/rbac/service/UserServiceTest.java`:
200:       user CRUD, unique username, activate/deactivate transitions, single-assignment rule
201: 
202: ### Implementation for User Story 3
203: 
204: - [X] T032 [US3] Implement `UserService` in
205:       `src/main/java/com/example/rbac/service/UserService.java` (CRUD, status transitions,
206:       `assignRoles` full-replace, effective-permission lookup via PermissionResolver,
207:       G2/G3 guardrails, optimistic locking) — depends on T004–T010
208: - [X] T033 [P] [US3] Implement `UserController` in
209:       `src/main/java/com/example/rbac/web/UserController.java` (list w/ paging+search, new,
210:       detail, edit, status, roles) per `contracts/users.md`
211: - [X] T034 [P] [US3] Create User Thymeleaf templates (list, new, detail with effective
212:       permissions panel, edit, role-assignment multi-select) in
213:       `src/main/resources/templates/user/`
214: - [X] T035 [US3] Wire audit logging for user create/edit/status and role-assignment changes
215:       through `AuditService`
216: - [X] T036 [US3] Verify user story: run UserAuthorizationTest, UserGuardrailTest,
217:       UserServiceTest green; manual pass of Quickstart steps 3 and 4 (self-service 403 demo)
218: 
219: **Checkpoint**: All user stories functional; full RBAC loop demonstrable end-to-end.
